    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ***🤖 Discord AI Auto-Moderator***\n\n#### **Workflow Process**\n* **Trigger:** Runs on a schedule (e.g., every 10 minutes).\n* **Fetch:** Grabs recent messages from the public chat.\n* **Analyze:** Sends each message to the **Google Perspective API** to score for:\n    * `TOXICITY`\n    * `SEVERE_TOXICITY`\n    * `THREAT`\n* **Combine:** Merges the original message (author, ID) with its new **AI scores**.\n\n---\n\n#### **Moderation Logic**\n* **Check:** Does the message meet **ANY** of these flags?\n    * `Toxicity` > **0.8**\n    * `Severe Toxicity` > **0.7**\n    * `Threat` > **0.6**\n\n* ✅ **If TRUE (Message Flagged):**\n    1.  **Alert:** Sends a full report (with all 3 scores) to `#admin-log`.\n    2.  **Delete:** Removes the original message from the public channel.\n\n* ❌ **If FALSE (Message Clean):**\n    * Stops and does nothing.\n\n---\n\n#### 🚨 **Error Handling**\n* If the **Google API fails**, a separate alert is sent to `#admin-log` so you know the bot is having issues",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 544,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
